@host = http://localhost:5000

### Locations (CLVN-002)
GET {{host}}/api/locations

### Conference rooms at a location (CLVN-003)
GET {{host}}/api/conference-rooms?locationId=koeln

### Filter rooms by capacity + equipment (CLVN-004/005/013)
GET {{host}}/api/conference-rooms?locationId=koeln&minCapacity=6&equipment=Whiteboard,Videokonferenz&sort=-capacity

### Room availability for a slot, with alternatives on conflict (CLVN-010/012)
GET {{host}}/api/conference-rooms/KR-KOE-01/availability?date=2026-06-19&timeFrom=10:00&timeTo=11:30

### Occupied slots of a room on a day (CLVN-011)
GET {{host}}/api/conference-rooms/KR-KOE-01/bookings?date=2026-06-19

### Workplaces for a location/date (CLVN-014)
GET {{host}}/api/workplaces?locationId=koeln&date=2026-06-18

### Test users for prototype login (CLVN-028/029)
GET {{host}}/api/users

### My bookings (CLVN-022/023)
GET {{host}}/api/bookings?userId=alice

### Booking detail (CLVN-024)
GET {{host}}/api/bookings/CLVN-B-1002

### Create a booking (CLVN-016..020)
POST {{host}}/api/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "ConferenceRoom",
  "resourceId": "KR-KOE-01",
  "locationId": "koeln",
  "userId": "bob",
  "date": "2026-06-20",
  "timeFrom": "14:00",
  "timeTo": "15:00",
  "title": "Architektur-Review",
  "notes": "Bitte Beamer bereitstellen."
}

### Modify a booking (CLVN-027)
PUT {{host}}/api/bookings/CLVN-B-1002
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "ConferenceRoom",
  "resourceId": "KR-KOE-01",
  "locationId": "koeln",
  "date": "2026-06-19",
  "timeFrom": "11:00",
  "timeTo": "12:00",
  "title": "Team-Sync (verschoben)"
}

### Export a booking as .ics (CLVN-025)
GET {{host}}/api/bookings/CLVN-B-1002/export

### Cancel a booking (CLVN-026)
POST {{host}}/api/bookings/CLVN-B-1002/cancellation

### Delete a booking (hard delete)
DELETE {{host}}/api/bookings/CLVN-B-1002
